[{"answer":"My guest on the show today is Alice Riches","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/1.mp3"},{"answer":"who started the Street Play Scheme where she lives in Beechwood Road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/2.mp3"},{"answer":"For those of you that don't already know,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Street Play involves local residents closing off their street for a few hours","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/4.mp3"},{"answer":"so that children have a chance to play in the street safely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/5.mp3"},{"answer":"She started it in her own street, Beechwood Road,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/6.mp3"},{"answer":"and the idea caught on,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/7.mp3"},{"answer":"and there are now Street Play Schemes all over the city.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/8.mp3"},{"answer":"So when did you actually start the scheme, Alice?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I first had the idea when my oldest child was still a toddler,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/10.mp3"},{"answer":"so that's about six years ago now,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/11.mp3"},{"answer":"but it took at least two years of campaigning before we were actually able to make it happen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/12.mp3"},{"answer":"So the scheme's been up and running for three years now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/13.mp3"},{"answer":"We'd love to be able to close our road for longer,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/14.mp3"},{"answer":"for the whole weekend, from Saturday morning until Sunday evening, for example.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/15.mp3"},{"answer":"At the moment it's just once a week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/16.mp3"},{"answer":"But when we started it was only once a month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/17.mp3"},{"answer":"But we're working on it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/18.mp3"},{"answer":"So what actually happens when Beechwood Road is closed?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/19.mp3"},{"answer":"We have volunteer wardens,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/20.mp3"},{"answer":"mostly parents but some elderly residents too,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/21.mp3"},{"answer":"who block off our road at either end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/22.mp3"},{"answer":"The council have provided special signs","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/23.mp3"},{"answer":"but there's always a volunteer there to explain what's happening to any motorists.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Generally, they're fine about it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/25.mp3"},{"answer":"we've only had to get the police involved once or twice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Now I should explain that the road isn't completely closed to cars.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/27.mp3"},{"answer":"But only residents' cars are allowed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/28.mp3"},{"answer":"If people really need to get in or out of Beechwood Road,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/29.mp3"},{"answer":"it's not a problem,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/30.mp3"},{"answer":"as long as they drive at under 20 kilometres per hour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/31.mp3"},{"answer":"But most people just decide not to use their cars during this time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/32.mp3"},{"answer":"or they park in another street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/33.mp3"},{"answer":"The wardens are only there to stop through traffic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/34.mp3"},{"answer":"So can anyone apply to get involved in Street Play?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/36.mp3"},{"answer":"We want to include all kids in the city,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/37.mp3"},{"answer":"especially those who live on busy roads.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/38.mp3"},{"answer":"It's here that demand is greatest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Obviously, there isn't such demand in wealthier areas","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/40.mp3"},{"answer":"where the children have access to parks or large gardens,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/41-2024-10-25-10-41-52.mp3"},{"answer":"or in the suburbs where there are usually more places for children to play outside.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd recommend that anyone listening who likes the idea should just give it a go.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/43.mp3"},{"answer":"We've been surprised by the positive reaction of residents all over the city.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/44.mp3"},{"answer":"And that's not just parents.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/45.mp3"},{"answer":"There are always a few who complain but they're a tiny minority.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/46.mp3"},{"answer":"On the whole everyone is very supportive","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and say they're very happy to see children out on the street,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/48.mp3"},{"answer":"even if it does get quite noisy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/49.mp3"},{"answer":"There have been so many benefits of Street Play for the kids.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Parents really like the fact that the kids are getting fresh air","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/51.mp3"},{"answer":"instead of sitting staring at a computer screen,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/52.mp3"},{"answer":"even if they're not doing anything particularly energetic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/53.mp3"},{"answer":"And of course it's great that kids can play with their friends outside without being supervised by their parents,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/54.mp3"},{"answer":"but for me the biggest advantage is that kids develop confidence in themselves to be outside without their parents.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/55.mp3"},{"answer":"The other really fantastic thing is that children get to know the adults in the street,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/56.mp3"},{"answer":"it's like having a big extended family.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/57.mp3"},{"answer":"It certainly does have a lot of benefits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/58.mp3"},{"answer":"I want to move on now and ask you about a related project in King Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Well this was an experiment I was involved in","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/61.mp3"},{"answer":"where local residents decided to try and reduce the traffic along King Street,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/62.mp3"},{"answer":"which is the busiest main road in our area,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/63.mp3"},{"answer":"by persuading people not to use their cars for one day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/64.mp3"},{"answer":"We thought about making people pay more for parking,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/65.mp3"},{"answer":"but we decided that would be really unpopular,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/66.mp3"},{"answer":"so instead we just stopped people from parking on King Street","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/67.mp3"},{"answer":"but left the other car parks open.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/68.mp3"},{"answer":"It was surprising how much of a difference all this made.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/69.mp3"},{"answer":"As we'd predicted, air quality was significantly better","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/70.mp3"},{"answer":"but what I hadn't expected was how much quieter it would be,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/71.mp3"},{"answer":"even with the buses still running.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course everyone said they felt safer","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/73.mp3"},{"answer":"but we were actually amazed that sales in the shops went up considerably that day,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/74.mp3"},{"answer":"we thought there'd be fewer people out shopping, not more.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/75.mp3"},{"answer":"That's really interesting...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-2-2023-01-18-10-53-12/76.mp3"}]
